WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5309055Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5319171Z ^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5319738Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5320612Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5321071Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5321498Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5322991Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5323628Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5323939Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5324387Z    if you are ready to continue.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5324601Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5325025Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5326267Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5326857Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5327341Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5327536Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5327737Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5328030Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5328258Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5328683Z    can use Nix.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5328849Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5328970Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5329153Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5329471Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5329986Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5331797Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5332875Z I will:
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5333180Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5333454Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5333966Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5334457Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5334927Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5335261Z  - install Nix in /nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5335577Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5336374Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5336850Z    /root
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5347667Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5348515Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5359440Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T13:27:15.5360206Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
